 <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Connected To</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">3</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n        <div class=\"topic-examples\">\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/afton-robotics/william-afton\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>William Afton</strong>\n                    <span>was the main antagonist of the Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s Scott Games series.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/freddy-fazbear\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Freddy Fazbear</strong>\n                    <span>is the titular antagonist of the Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s series and the main of the four original animatronics of Freddy Fazbear&#039;s Pizza.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n                <a\n                    href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/possession\"\n                    class=\"connection\"\n                    data-relationship=\"Connected To\"\n                >\n                    <strong>Possession</strong>\n                    <span>Spirits binding to animatronics after death.</span>\n                </a>\n            \n        </div>\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/afton-robotics/william-afton\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            William Afton\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Afton is the franchise&#039;s central human monster.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/freddy-fazbear\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Freddy Fazbear\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Freddy is the franchise mascot.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Connected To\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/possession\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Possession\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Possession drives the hauntings.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n<section class=\"topic-section\">\n    <details>\n        <summary class=\"topic-summary\">\n            <span class=\"topic-title\">Created By</span>\n            <span class=\"topic-count\">1</span>\n        </summary>\n\n        \n\n        <div class=\"topic-content\">\n            \n                <div class=\"fact-card\">\n                    <div class=\"fact-label\">\n                        Created By\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h3>\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/scott-cawthon\" class=\"entity-link\">\n            Scott Cawthon\n        </a>\n    </h3>\n\n                    <p>Scott Cawthon created Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s.</p>\n\n                    \n\n                    \n                </div>\n            \n        </div>\n    </details>\n</section>\n\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"did-you-know\">\n    <h2>Did you know?</h2>\n    <ul>\n        <li>Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s is also referenced as FNAF, Five Nights at Freddies.</li><li>Afton is the franchise&#039;s central human monster.</li><li>Scott Cawthon created Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s.</li><li>Freddy is the franchise mascot.</li><li>FNAF 1 begins the franchise.</li><li>Evidence around Five Nights at Freddy&#039;s is classified as fiction on Ton-o-Lore.</li>\n    </ul>\n</section>\n\n\n<section class=\"sources\">\n    <h2>Sources &amp; further reading</h2>\n    <p><a href=\"https://freddy-fazbears-pizza.fandom.com/wiki/Five_Nights_at_Freddy%27s\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Fandom wiki</a></p>\n</section>","overview":"<section class=\"overview\">\n    <h2>What is Five Nights at Freddy's?</h2>\n\n    <p>\n        <strong>Five Nights at Freddy's</strong> is a horror franchise created by\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/scott-cawthon\" class=\"entity-link\">Scott Cawthon</a>.\n        It begins with night shifts at\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza\" class=\"entity-link\">Freddy Fazbear's Pizza</a>,\n        where animatronics like\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/freddy-fazbear\" class=\"entity-link\">Freddy Fazbear</a>,\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/bonnie\" class=\"entity-link\">Bonnie</a>,\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/chica\" class=\"entity-link\">Chica</a>, and\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/freddy-fazbears-pizza/foxy\" class=\"entity-link\">Foxy</a>\n        refuse to stay on stage.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        Behind the birthday parties is\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/afton-robotics/william-afton\" class=\"entity-link\">William Afton</a>,\n        the\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/missing-children-incident\" class=\"entity-link\">missing children incident</a>,\n        and\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/possession\" class=\"entity-link\">possession</a>\n        that turns mascots into vessels for revenge — from\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/fazbears-fright/springtrap\" class=\"entity-link\">Springtrap</a>\n        to\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/glitchtrap\" class=\"entity-link\">Glitchtrap</a>.\n    </p>\n\n    <p>\n        The story stretches across\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/sister-location\" class=\"entity-link\">Sister Location</a>,\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/security-breach\" class=\"entity-link\">Security Breach</a>,\n        and the\n        <a href=\"/five-nights-at-freddys/mega-pizzaplex\" class=\"entity-link\">Mega Pizzaplex</a>,\n        always circling the same question: how do you close a restaurant that will not die?\n    </p>\n</section>","word_count":914,"uniqueness_score":"1.0000"},"entity":{"id":"888edda5-ce55-4775-8ad6-14de87407a8e","name":"Five Nights at Freddy's","slug":"five-nights-at-freddys","type":"work","kind":"series","type_label":"Series","short_description":", commonly abbreviated as FNaF and often referred to as Five Nights at Freddy's 1 or FNaF1, is an independent point-and-click sit-and-survive horror game developed and published by Scottgames, LLC, which released on…","description":", commonly abbreviated as FNaF and often referred to as Five Nights at Freddy's 1 or FNaF1, is an independent point-and-click sit-and-survive horror game developed and published by Scottgames, LLC, which released on August 8, 2014, for Windows, as the first installment in the Five Nights at Freddy's series. Shortly after, the game was ported to Android on August 24, 2014, Amazon Fire OS on August 26, 2014, iOS on September 11, 2014, and Windows Phone on December 2, 2014.\n\nScottgames would partner with Clickteam LLC in 2018 to deliver HD, improved \"remastered\" ports to mobile and consoles. The mobile updates would release on July 30, 2019, for iOS, and August 16, 2019, for Android. The Xbox port would release on November 28, 2019, and the PlayStation and Nintendo Switch ports on November 29, 2019. These ports/updates would fix bugs, remove copyrighted material, and add a subtitles and cheats menu.\n\nDue to its universal success upon release, the game spawned a media franchise for a series of video games, spin-offs, books, and merchandise, as well as a film adaptation, which was released on October 27, 2023.\n\nWelcome to your new summer job at Freddy Fazbear's Pizza, where kids and parents alike come for entertainment and food as far as the eye can see! The main attraction is Freddy Fazbear, of course; and his two friends. They are animatronic robots, programmed to please the crowds! The robots' behavior has become somewhat unpredictable at night however, and it was much cheaper to hire you as a security guard than to find a repairman.","evidence":"fiction","universe":"five-nights-at-freddys","aliases":["FNAF","Five Nights at Freddy's","Five Nights at Freddies"],"wikipedia_url":null,"image_url":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/freddy-fazbears-pizza/images/d/da/FNaF1.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/360?cb=20230410020858","image_source":"https://freddy-fazbears-pizza.fandom.com/wiki/Five_Nights_at_Freddy%27s","image_credit":"Fair-use identification thumbnail via Fandom. Character / franchise art © Scott Cawthon / Steel Wool / rights holders (as applicable). Not free or redistributable artwork.","image_license":"fair_use","image_usage":"fair_use_identification","image_alt":"Identification thumbnail for Five Nights at Freddy's"},"connections":[{"id":"2b514e10-270c-4254-9102-628581d24de1","relationship":"part_of","title":"Part of","explanation":"Part of","strength":"0.9000","discovery_score":"0.8500","direction":"incoming","from_entity_id":"581c96ab-fcc2-4b20-b75a-24766f015cd4","to_entity_id":"888edda5-ce55-4775-8ad6-14de87407a8e","entity_id":"581c96ab-fcc2-4b20-b75a-24766f015cd4","slug":"bonnie-bowl","name":"Bonnie Bowl","type":"place","short_description":